The way WebDriverAgent is reached and started — a usbmuxd tunnel to its port, a
session without idle waits, `xcodebuild test-without-building` from a signed
build, and the plugin's configuration keys so its setup can be reused — follows
that project, rewritten in PHP. The phone side is Appium's WebDriverAgent
(https://github.com/appium/WebDriverAgent, BSD-3-Clause), which this package
does not include.
